OL,3,GNEWSAFans share memories of rugby
OL,4,Aleague legend Billy Boston
OL,5,
OL,6,FFans have shared memories of the
OL,7,Fmuch-loved rugby league legend Sir
OL,8,FBilly Boston and signed a book of
OL,9,Fcondolence at his former club Wigan
OL,10,FWarriors.
OL,12,FRugby league's first knight died
OL,13,Fearlier this week aged 92 surrounded by
OL,14,Fhis closest family, the club said.
OL,16,FAs well as his achievements on the
OL,17,Fpitch - including scoring 571 tries in
OL,18,Fhis career - a total surpassed only by
OL,19,FAustralian legend Brian Bevan in
OL,20,Ftop-class rugby league - Boston has a
OL,21,Flegion of fans heartbroken at the
OL,22,Flegend's death.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
