OL,3,GNEWSAFans share memories of rugby
OL,4,Aleague legend Billy Boston
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe club's kitman, and a lifelong fan
OL,7,Fwho first saw him as a child, and
OL,8,Fdecades later worked for him in his pub
OL,9,Fwhen he retired, were among hundreds
OL,10,Fwho went to Robin Park Arena to pay
OL,11,Ftribute to the star.
